# Passwords. Never commit these.
redeem/.env
.env

# An old voucher database, if a copy is still lying about. The pre-drawn pool
# was removed in August 2026 and nothing writes this file any more, but an old
# one is client data and does not belong on GitHub.
Ledger/vouchers.db
Ledger/vouchers.db-wal
Ledger/vouchers.db-shm

# The redemption site's database. On PythonAnywhere this lives outside the
# repository anyway, which is what stops a git pull taking the redemptions.
redeem/data/

# Issued vouchers and the files that made them. Real voucher numbers and real
# event names: this is client data, and it does not belong on GitHub.
Output/
Uploads/
Ledger/issued_vouchers.csv
# Issued-voucher records are operational data, never source.
Ledger/*.csv

# Client artwork, supplied separately.
assets/*.png
assets/*.jpg
assets/*.svg

# The loose copy the generator refreshes each run.
/Vendor instructions.pdf

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Internal drafts and correspondence. Stays in Dropbox, not on GitHub.
Reply to Jay.txt

# The healthcare film that was briefly merged in here from the benchmarking
# repository. The files stay in the folder, but they belong to that repo, not
# to the voucher app.
/index.html
/insiderpro-healthcare-v2.mp4
/poster.jpg
/.nojekyll
/.gitattributes

# Local launch config for the preview tooling. Not part of the app.
/.claude/

# Output of check_pdf_engine.py. Test renders, not vouchers.
/engine-check/

# Pool transfers. Real voucher numbers, and big. Move them by hand.
pool-transfer*.jsonl.gz
